	(text "04_PPG — DUAL MAX86141 OPTICAL HR / SpO2 FRONT END — REV A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "04686165-3557-49f6-acb4-b517df67b806")
	)
	(text "AFE architecture: both MAX86141 devices share SPI SCLK/MOSI/MISO; each has its own CS and active-low open-drain INT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 211.176 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "0842a02e-c398-4a68-a7c2-53f7a4f62eb8")
	)
	(text "VDD_ANA and VDD_DIG use the same VOUT1_1V8 rail and must be shorted locally at each WLP. ADI layout guidance calls for 22uF + 0.1uF combined decoupling and 1uF on VREF."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 223.976 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "3c6a3c67-a62f-4d68-9807-e02b6754b13c")
	)
	(text "Apple-inspired optical architecture: 12 independently selected emitters total = 4 green + 4 red + 3 IR850 + 1 IR940, with the existing four SFH2703H photodiodes. Each MAX86141 uses a 3x2:1 LED mux bank."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 217.576 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5a9779e5-ed77-4de2-b336-b71ab236d74b")
	)
	(text "PD_GND1/2 are separate shield/reference nets and join PCB GND only through NT401/NT402. Use real net-tie copper/footprints, not resistors, during PCB footprint/layout audit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 227.176 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "5cfa9a5a-e71e-4624-88c4-fe91b1d8b66d")
	)
	(text "Custom SFH7018A, SFH4053B, SFH2703H and TS5A12301E symbols are embedded; exact new optical/mux footprints remain for the dedicated footprint audit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 18 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.85 0.85)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8c59c736-4b75-42f8-9a29-fe593a00b346")
	)
	(text "MAX86141 imported WLP footprint is retained for now. ALL three custom optical footprints plus WLP ball orientation are verified during the dedicated pre-PCB footprint audit."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 239.976 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "b802c43a-dd4e-4c07-a3d8-903bc833bfb4")
	)
	(text "GPIO1 of both AFEs remains PPG_SAMPLE_SYNC. Use GPIO_CTRL=1010: falling GPIO1 starts one sample; GPIO2 is automatic external-mux control (HIGH for LED1/2/3, LOW for LED4/5/6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 214.376 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c0ff339f-7861-440d-b4f1-bbe5339d34b1")
	)
	(text "CRITICAL PCB: fully shield each PD_IN with its corresponding PD_GND; no unrelated traces/vias through or over the PD_GND shield. Keep PD paths extremely short."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 230.376 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c53e52a6-4bd6-4978-8a98-024666fb5f57")
	)
	(text "SFH7018A exact pad map embedded from OSRAM: 1/7/8 green cathode, 2/4 red+IR anode, 3 IR cathode, 5 red cathode, 6 green anode. SFH2703H symbol uses pin1 cathode, pin2 anode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 236.776 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ddf7f812-942d-4d1c-8176-d6cf5a177b3b")
	)
	(text "Keep the complete PPG analog/optical region away from Wi-Fi/GNSS RF, display/high-speed buses, switchers, inductors and the haptic actuator. Optical barriers and source-detector spacing are mechanical-design items."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 233.576 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e1eaff15-9a3a-46da-85dd-716660853188")
	)
	(text "PPG_VLED is generated locally by U401 TPS631000 from protected VBAT. Nominal rail ~3.82 V; EN follows VOUT1_1V8. Keep VLED switching/layout away from PD_IN/PD_GND and optical analog nodes."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 18.542 220.776 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.65 0.65)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "e856457f-4128-40d5-a0a3-9e032a1bee2a")
	)
